  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">PATRON DIARIES</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Words of Elegance</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Cherished moments and experiences shared by our valued clientele.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          “The saree arrived in the most exquisite keepsake box. The fabric feels like liquid silk and the craftsmanship exceeded every expectation. I received countless compliments at my sister’s wedding!”
        </blockquote>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <strong>Priya Sharma</strong>
          <span>Verified Patron &bull; New Delhi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          “NIRALI has become my sole destination for authentic handlooms. The chiffon drape is featherlight yet carries such a regal presence. Truly an heirloom piece.”
        </blockquote>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <strong>Anjali Patel</strong>
          <span>Verified Patron &bull; Ahmedabad</span>
        </div>
